      "description": {
        "fun": "Minior is born high in the stratosphere from mutated nanoparticles, building a rocky shell out of the dust it eats until it gets too heavy and falls to the ground like a shooting star. When the shell breaks, a bright core shows through in one of seven rainbow colours, set by the dust it ate. The bare core can't survive for long, and fallen Minior trying to return to space fade away unless someone catches them in a Poké Ball.",
        "guide": "Minior is a Rock- and Flying-type Pokémon from Alola based on meteors. Its Shields Down Ability keeps it in its rocky Meteor Form until its HP drops below half, then exposes its core, which comes in seven colours. It doesn't evolve.",
        "tagline": "A shooting star with a rainbow-coloured surprise inside",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Minior (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Minior_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
          }
        ]
      },
